OL,3,ACounting set to begin in the Holborn
OL,4,Aand St Pancras by-election
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolls have closed in the Holborn and St
OL,7,FPancras by-election - votes will be
OL,8,Fcounted in the coming hours
OL,10,FThe seat became vacant after former
OL,11,FPrime Minister Keir Starmer announced
OL,12,Fhe was standing down from the House of
OL,13,FCommons last month
OL,15,FFifteen candidates are standing in the
OL,16,Fby-election - you can read a full list
OL,17,Fhere
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
