OL,3,ACounting set to begin in the Holborn
OL,4,Aand St Pancras by-election
OL,5,
OL,6,FHolborn and St Pancras is a
OL,7,Fconstituency full of well-known London
OL,8,Flandmarks, and just under half of
OL,9,Fresidents are aged under-30 - take a
OL,10,Flook at our rundown here
OL,12,FThe result is expected to be declared
OL,13,Fbefore breakfast time on Friday
